      "bbox": [
        379,
        1318,
        1932,
        1540
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to ensure the high quality and integrity of appointments at the policy making level, I am modifying my instructions dated February 2, 1967 (Executive Order No. 37) and January 19, 1966 (Executive Order No. 5), by the addition of the following paragraph, to be I-D:",
